<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/259408c8-0c3f-40d1-8d01-bb5fb268dbae> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "D7: Resolution order for singularize and pluralize" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/259408c8-0c3f-40d1-8d01-bb5fb268dbae> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/b9851667-ab87-40ac-bffd-99cd5802ffd2> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/259408c8-0c3f-40d1-8d01-bb5fb268dbae> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/cdaaaded-bd10-485e-a590-f298e66ab80d> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/259408c8-0c3f-40d1-8d01-bb5fb268dbae> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/259408c8-0c3f-40d1-8d01-bb5fb268dbae> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "singularize: 0 overrides → 1 acronym plural (all-caps stem + lower-case s/es: IDs, SKUs) → 2 INVARIANT unchanged → 3 IRREGULAR supplement, SINGULAR_CHOICE, FORM_TO_LEMMA minus EXCLUDED_FORMS → 4 checked rules whose output is in NOUNS → 5 known word (NOUNS ∪ NAMES) unchanged → 6 conservative fallback. Checked rules, in order: -ies→-ie, -ies→-y, sibilant+es→strip es, -s→strip, -oes→-o, -ves→-f/-fe; output ≥3 letters. pluralize: 0 overrides → 1 INVARIANT unchanged → 2 already plural (known plural form that is not itself a noun, or a checked rule maps it to a noun while it is not one) unchanged → 3 IRREGULAR supplement, PLURAL_CHOICE, LEMMA_TO_PLURAL → 4 regular rules. Crate docs in src/lib.rs are updated to state this order." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/259408c8-0c3f-40d1-8d01-bb5fb268dbae> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
