<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/372214e8-e84c-4017-9c02-d5cf369ce81c> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "P2: Hand-curated closed invariant list" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/372214e8-e84c-4017-9c02-d5cf369ce81c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/5716d820-8bd9-4f9e-90b0-257b9c4a72f2> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/372214e8-e84c-4017-9c02-d5cf369ce81c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/372214e8-e84c-4017-9c02-d5cf369ce81c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "INVARIANT is hand-written in src/policy.rs, closed at about 80–120 entries, each with a reason. The generator checks that every entry is a WordNet noun. It is not copied from any third-party inflector, which keeps the licensing clean. Seeds:\n- zero plurals: sheep, deer, fish, moose, swine, bison, salmon, aircraft, spacecraft, offspring;\n- -s singulars and mass-reading pluralia tantum: news, series, species, means, headquarters, logistics;\n- field-of-study -ics, reviewed individually from the 31 found: physics, ethics, mathematics, economics and linguistics are in; metrics, graphics and tactics are not;\n- mass nouns whose -s form misleads in data text: data, metadata, information, equipment, software, feedback, research, evidence, personnel, police, cattle.\nAn invariant entry is unchanged in both directions. Overrides beat it." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/372214e8-e84c-4017-9c02-d5cf369ce81c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/372214e8-e84c-4017-9c02-d5cf369ce81c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-10-17T18:44:25.464417Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
