<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/6cf2837f-dd1c-44b9-a28f-20017d84c929> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "P4: -oes/-ves plurals only where WordNet lists them" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/6cf2837f-dd1c-44b9-a28f-20017d84c929> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/30e45192-cd0e-479f-ba52-0b7aad475394> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/6cf2837f-dd1c-44b9-a28f-20017d84c929> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/cdaaaded-bd10-485e-a590-f298e66ab80d> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/6cf2837f-dd1c-44b9-a28f-20017d84c929> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/6cf2837f-dd1c-44b9-a28f-20017d84c929> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "pluralize gives -o and -f/-fe nouns a plain -s unless WordNet's form list has an -oes or -ves form. WordNet lists -oes for 83 of 628 -o lemmas (potatoes, heroes, tomatoes, echoes, vetoes) and -ves for 38 of 269 -f/-fe lemmas (wolves, knives, leaves, halves); photos, roofs and chiefs get -s. The generator drops two kinds of form from the plural direction by a mechanical rule: regular spelling variants (busses, gasses) and a form equal to its own lemma, unless that is the only form (forceps). Precedence: overrides, then invariant, then irregular (supplement, PLURAL_CHOICE, WordNet), then regular rules." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/6cf2837f-dd1c-44b9-a28f-20017d84c929> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/6cf2837f-dd1c-44b9-a28f-20017d84c929> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-10-17T18:44:25.572773Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
