<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/6e89d21f-249d-464f-ac4b-13b665794d15> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "D5: Inflector override builder" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/6e89d21f-249d-464f-ac4b-13b665794d15> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/b9851667-ab87-40ac-bffd-99cd5802ffd2> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/6e89d21f-249d-464f-ac4b-13b665794d15> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/6e89d21f-249d-464f-ac4b-13b665794d15> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Caller overrides via Inflector::builder().pair(singular, plural).invariant(word).build() -> Result<Inflector, OverrideError>. build() lower-cases and sorts once into owned sorted views by singular and by plural, rejecting duplicate or conflicting pairs. The value is immutable, Send + Sync, held by the host — no global mutable state. Overrides are checked first in both directions; override singulars count as known words. Free functions are the same code with an empty override set. OverrideError implements Display + Debug (MSRV 1.70 excludes core::error::Error)." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/6e89d21f-249d-464f-ac4b-13b665794d15> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/6e89d21f-249d-464f-ac4b-13b665794d15> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-10-17T18:43:50.755489Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
