<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d24bf872-b2b4-4e24-8998-1ca80a3469d2> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "pub fn is_noun(word) -> bool: true when the word, or the singular given by the irregular tables or a checked rule, is a WordNet noun. Falls out of the lookups at no extra cost and lets a host distinguish 'unchanged because known' from 'unchanged because unknown' (e.g. only trusting dictionary-checked matches)." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d24bf872-b2b4-4e24-8998-1ca80a3469d2> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
