<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/fa896947-7545-4ab5-a32a-f640a1b45645> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "P3: Conservative fallback for unknown words" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/fa896947-7545-4ab5-a32a-f640a1b45645> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/cdaaaded-bd10-485e-a590-f298e66ab80d> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/fa896947-7545-4ab5-a32a-f640a1b45645> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/fa896947-7545-4ab5-a32a-f640a1b45645> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Applies only to words WordNet doesn't contain. The rules run only on lower-case words of at least 4 letters, or on the acronym-plural shape:\n- `-ies`→`-y` after a consonant;\n- sibilant + `es`→strip `es`;\n- `-s`→strip after a consonant or after e, o or y.\nLeft unchanged: `-as`, `-is`, `-us`, `-ss`, capitalised words (Kubernetes, Athens, Mercedes), and words containing digits or symbols. pluralize uses the regular rules for unknown words." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/fa896947-7545-4ab5-a32a-f640a1b45645> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
