<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/fc760bb9-03a7-48dd-88bb-9850b9951804> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "P1: Strip wins by default; refuse only genuinely ambiguous classes" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/fc760bb9-03a7-48dd-88bb-9850b9951804> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/3bd26ec5-16d9-4652-8d22-6133ab4469ac> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/fc760bb9-03a7-48dd-88bb-9850b9951804> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/5716d820-8bd9-4f9e-90b0-257b9c4a72f2> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
