<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/5679b6a7-ffc3-49e6-8ff8-a1c231b3ab0b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Code and curated policy lists are Apache-2.0; generated tables are CC BY 4.0 (Open English WordNet) with the Princeton WordNet 3.0 notice. LICENSE-DATA ships in the package and describes exactly how the data is derived; generated files carry a header with source, edition and sha256. Curated lists stay in crate source, separate from the generated tables, and are never copied into them." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
