<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/72d3c2ee-e6e2-468a-94d3-14722164d43d> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "No heuristic guesses without the WordNet noun check except the final fallback for words WordNet does not contain, and that fallback stays conservative: leaving a word unchanged beats inventing a non-word." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
