<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/8e547b3c-903b-4043-afbf-b23409fbde9d> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/8e547b3c-903b-4043-afbf-b23409fbde9d> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Tables are generated only from the release pinned in data/MANIFEST.toml (URL + sha256); the generator refuses on a hash mismatch. Same inputs give byte-identical output (byte-sorted, no timestamps, \\n endings). Generated files are never hand-edited; bumping the release is a deliberate separate change. The 2025 Turtle releases are not usable (no inflected forms); the WN-LMF XML is the input." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/8e547b3c-903b-4043-afbf-b23409fbde9d> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/8e547b3c-903b-4043-afbf-b23409fbde9d> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-10-17T18:43:08.131642Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/8e547b3c-903b-4043-afbf-b23409fbde9d> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Pinned data, byte-identical regeneration" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Lesson/a844efd0-005c-4bcb-8f7a-b03d595bc463> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Lesson> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Lesson/a844efd0-005c-4bcb-8f7a-b03d595bc463> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Measure a class before curating it" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Lesson/a844efd0-005c-4bcb-8f7a-b03d595bc463> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/5716d820-8bd9-4f9e-90b0-257b9c4a72f2> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Lesson/a844efd0-005c-4bcb-8f7a-b03d595bc463> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Lesson/a844efd0-005c-4bcb-8f7a-b03d595bc463> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Before planning a hand-curated list, count how many entries fall in each class in the actual data. Let a default rule cover the bulk, and refuse or curate only the genuinely ambiguous rows (tens to low hundreds). If an ambiguous class runs into the thousands, choose a structural tie-break instead of a list. Learned when the first P1 draft proposed refusing every input where both the word and its stripped form are nouns: about 460 rows, and the class grows with WordNet's plural-form lemmas (arms, goods, customs)." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Lesson/a844efd0-005c-4bcb-8f7a-b03d595bc463> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Lesson/a844efd0-005c-4bcb-8f7a-b03d595bc463> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-10-17T18:44:25.66769Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Lesson/a844efd0-005c-4bcb-8f7a-b03d595bc463> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Measure a class before curating it" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Lesson/a844efd0-005c-4bcb-8f7a-b03d595bc463> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#learnedFrom> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/fc760bb9-03a7-48dd-88bb-9850b9951804> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Pattern/c3825b8b-b3a2-4238-bf18-20fb8d75ce45> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Pattern> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Pattern/c3825b8b-b3a2-4238-bf18-20fb8d75ce45> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Generator refuses unclassified or stale policy" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Pattern/c3825b8b-b3a2-4238-bf18-20fb8d75ce45> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/3bd26ec5-16d9-4652-8d22-6133ab4469ac> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Pattern/c3825b8b-b3a2-4238-bf18-20fb8d75ce45> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/5716d820-8bd9-4f9e-90b0-257b9c4a72f2> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Pattern/c3825b8b-b3a2-4238-bf18-20fb8d75ce45> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Pattern/c3825b8b-b3a2-4238-bf18-20fb8d75ce45> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "gen-data fails when any genuinely ambiguous entry (classes B, C and D) has no curated choice, when a curated entry no longer matches any ambiguity (stale), or when an invariant or supplement entry is not a WordNet noun. report prints exactly the offending entries as ready-to-paste lines, so fixing it means adding lines. Effect: a WordNet release bump cannot change behaviour on ambiguous words without a human decision." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Pattern/c3825b8b-b3a2-4238-bf18-20fb8d75ce45> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Pattern/c3825b8b-b3a2-4238-bf18-20fb8d75ce45> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-10-17T18:44:25.629918Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Pattern/c3825b8b-b3a2-4238-bf18-20fb8d75ce45> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Generator refuses unclassified or stale policy" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
