<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/58238d19-563a-4127-bc1e-3f7bbd063886> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Done only when: tests/cases.rs un-ignored and passing; NLTK WordNetLemmatizer differential run with every intentional difference listed (expected.tsv reproducible); gen-data --check byte-identical (CI job + fixture determinism test); cargo fmt --check, clippy --workspace --all-targets -D warnings, test --workspace clean; cargo package --list exactly the intended files and .crate well under 10 MB; binary-size and compile-time cost measured and recorded in README." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
