<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/a3e3108a-6c7f-46ea-b998-7c938688f5a6> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Every result deterministic and safe to display: never a non-word where a rule over-fires (unchanged is the safe failure); cheap calls (avoid allocation when the word comes back unchanged); optional caller-supplied override layer for domain forms (SKUs, ETAs, personnel) checked before built-in data, with no global mutable state; plain free functions remain the zero-config path." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/a3e3108a-6c7f-46ea-b998-7c938688f5a6> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
