<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/e5aa2222-b529-4d23-a9a4-07b172657df0> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Implement singularize/pluralize checked against Open English WordNet 2025, replacing the panicking skeleton. Scope: dev-only generator producing pinned, byte-identical, committed tables; runtime with allocation-free fast path; caller override layer; stated policies for ambiguous words; verification gates (acceptance table un-ignored, NLTK differential, byte-identical regeneration, fmt/clippy/test clean, cargo package --list exact, size/compile measured). Out of scope: synonyms/synsets, verb/adjective inflection, any runtime RDF loading. First consumer is a deterministic NLP query pipeline (~38 call sites: matching tokens to ontology labels, rendering class names) but the crate stays consumer-neutral. Full plan: tasks/todo.md." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/e5aa2222-b529-4d23-a9a4-07b172657df0> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
